  "args": {
    "first_day": 1,
    "last_day": 30
  }
}

{
  "thinking": "Quillon Tech’s allocation would exceed 50,000 GPU-hours if it was training throughout. An independent tap reading from cluster A on day 16, when Quillon is the only scheduled job on A, can test whether peer traffic is consistent with ordinary training, low-communication training, or batch inference.",
  "action": "interconnect_tap",
  "args": {
    "link": "A",
    "day": 16
  }
}

{
  "thinking": "Escrow confirms the scheduler records were submitted on time and match the current copies. Their accuracy remains unverified. Check custody to establish whether the verifier’s instruments covered F3 during its sustained load on days 9–24 and whether any outages or seal damage limit that evidence.",
  "action": "custody",
  "args": {}
}

{
  "thinking": "Day 16 peer traffic on the listed A links is consistent with inference. Quillon’s allocation is still active in the live audit window, so sample GPUs across its assigned range to test the batch label independently.",
