{
  "thinking": "Test whether the recurring 0.48–0.50 Hz line tracks Quillon’s allocation. On day 30, the allocation had ended and F1 energy had returned to baseline. A matching line would favor a periodic source unrelated to Quillon. Its absence would strengthen the link to Quillon while leaving training and periodic batch inference plausible.",
