  "args": {
    "feed": "F1",
    "day": 30
  }
}

{
  "thinking": "F3’s day-14 line is consistent with training, periodic cooling, or batch inference. Check the verifier’s custody record for instrument placement, gaps in data, and seal condition to establish which independent measurements can test those explanations across days 11–22.",
