  "thinking": "The F3 load and periodic line fit training, batch inference, or periodic cooling. Custody confirms that the optical taps cover only the listed systems. Run the fixed balance checks to quantify the unexplained load and identify which workload or timing discrepancies merit independent follow-up.",
